  "label": "User projected onto the visual representation of a transgender athlete",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman in the image, who is presented as a representative of 'trans-sports' as defined by the hateful text. The meme uses her confident posture and visible tattoos to visually embody the derogatory concept of 'trans-sports' — specifically, the stereotype that transgender athletes are 'medicore male athletes' who 'finally become champions' through transition. This projection implies the user is identifying with or imagining themselves as the target of this discriminatory framing, or is being invited to see themselves as the subject of this hateful narrative.",
